(text "Each rail uses two series 100k 0.1% resistors and a 20k 0.1% bottom resistor.\n10 nF filtering; long ADC acquisition. 30 V at the divider maps to about 2.73 V.\nThese dividers measure the sensor supplies AFTER protection. Firmware validates voltage and fault flags.\nU7D is unused: inputs fixed to GND/+3V3 and output unconnected." (at 160 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "75e28007-c2db-50aa-88c1-f1eed60625b1"))
